      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know what to do anymore. i feel like i havent slept or breathed in weeks. it's just constant. the meds, the doctors, the cleaning, the same routine every single day... it never stops and there's no end in sight. i feel like i'm disappearing. like there's nothing left of me besides this person who just serves everyone else. i'm just so incredibly tired.",
