      "content": "It doesn't sound crazy at all. In fact, it sounds like a desperate cry for relief. You're not asking for a miracle, just a chance to escape the suffocating weight of your situation. Your desire to stop is a natural response to the overwhelming pain and exhaustion you're feeling.",
